{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決算月は毎回忙しい。\n９月は特に半期だったし、\n伝票　伝票　伝票\nと毎日言っている日々でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近では、握手会とかでも\nサラリーマンやOLの子に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『今月決算で忙しいでしょ？\n大丈夫？？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われるようになり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嗚呼、社会人、、、\nわかってる、、、！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と感動さえ覚えています←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらこそいつも忙しいのに\n会いに来てくれてありがとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから年末にかけて\nもっとせわしく\nなるけど頑張ろうね(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会＆個別握手会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は深川さんとペアで\n麻衣眞衣レーンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな深川さんと同じレーンで\nめっちゃ楽しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた皆さん！\nお姉さんレーンどうでしたか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着いた感じで\n終始ほっこり～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいみんのみなさんも\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また同じレーンに\nなりたいな（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は１部２部３部でお洋服を\n変えました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言っても着回しなんだけど、\n少しでも雰囲気変えた方が楽しいかな？\nって思って挑戦してみたの(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白シャツ\nトレンチスカート\n大判ストール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイド三つ編み"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボルドートップス\nトレンチスカート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆるゆるハーフアップ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボルドートップス\nストライプスカート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはどれが好きですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全ての部に来てくれた方に\n聞いてみたら\n１部の服が好評だったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝早くから、会いに来てくれて\nありがとうございました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話内容としては\nアンダーライブが近いので、\nアンダーライブの話が多かったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはのぎ天！\n滝行やってほしかった！\nって声が多くてびっくり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも\nOL話\n個人PV予告\n今日の服について\n前日の全握\nブログ\nモバメ\nお弁当"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などいろんな話が出来ました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいつもありがとう。\n元気をもらっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回は１０月１８日！\n夏のFree＆Easy最後の握手会です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から楽しみだな～\nハロウィン近いし、\n仮装とかしてみたいなあ(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんちゃって(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで！\n前回の宣言通り、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お返事タイム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度、東京へ行くので\nおススメのスポットを教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→たくさんあるけど表参道とかかな？\n東京らしい人ごみもありつつ\n落ち着いた雰囲気があるから好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流行りのカフェとか、\nセレクトショップもあるし\nちょっと歩くとすぐ\n原宿にもいけるしね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと夜だったら東京タワーも\n好き～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参考になってるかな・・・？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若いなら、渋谷とか・・・？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もOLなんだけど、\n昼食の後とか眠くて仕方ないです。\n耐える方法を教えて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→わたしも同じくです・・・\n食べた後って凄まじい眠気が\n襲ってくるよね、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面目に答えると、\nこまめに席を立つことと\n声を出すことかな～^_^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんは気持ち切り替えたり\nするときはどんな方法をとっている？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→私の場合、何かを身体の中から\n出したい意欲に駆られるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"散歩とか半身浴をして、\n汗をだしてリフレッシュする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それか\nワザと感動する映画を見て\n涙を出す。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも頭がスッキリして\n切り替えられる気がするの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/0238468/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お試しあれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで、\n今日はここまでにしますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだたくさん\n質問してくれているので、\nこまめに返しますね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n長くなってしまったので、\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/10/03/e659ad21536f0eaae6d768dbfa414b602ede991f.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します！"}],"source":"archive"}